"""One bounded alternative for a taper cut by a physical junction mouth.

Keep valid centered tapers exactly. Otherwise place a full quintic of the same
minimum duration between the cuts and the two original Section bounds. The
original seam must remain inside the interval; transitions cannot overlap.
This changes generated taper placement, never source controls or dimensions.
"""
import bpy
from . import curved_dimension_nodes as dimensions

